ecutable\n> [4] 7ff998359496 (ntdll.dll+19496) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [5] 7ff9984a5d1d (ntdll.dll+165d1d) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [6] 7ff7594c3e20 (main+2d03e20) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [7] 7ff75947a2b5 (main+2cba2b5) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [8] 7ff75b37d961 (main+4bbd961) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [9] 7ff75a5c7dc0 (main+3e07dc0) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [10] 7ff758c4acd3 (main+248acd3) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [11] 7ff758c4b5d8 (main+248b5d8) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [12] 7ff758c4c134 (main+248c134) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [13] 7ff75681d43c (main+5d43c) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [14] 7ff7567c2ef0 (main+2ef0) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [15] 7ff756812501 (main+52501) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [16] 7ff75681253d (main+5253d) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [17] 7ff7567c10c8 (main+10c8) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [18] 7ff7567c13f5 (main+13f5) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [19] 7ff9966ee956 (kernel32.dll+2e956) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [20] 7ff99834427b (ntdll.dll+427b) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> [21] -1 (main+-7ff7567c0001) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n> -- END OF C++ BACKTRACE --\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a new project, create a 3D Scene root node, and then create a animation tree. Godot will then crash.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nA reproduction project is not needed, I was able to get this crash on an newly created project with nothing in it.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api